Z||000000||DaveL||02-27-2001||03:19 PM||||I have an 87 SE with one dented outside mirror on the driver side, and one with broken glass on the passenger side. Are these the same for all years? (manual adjust)||||reg||1
Z||000001||Tigger||02-27-2001||04:47 PM||||All manual mirror housings and glass are the same all years, try to look for those.  One of the housings for the PWR mirrors will work with manual mirrors, can't remember which one.  Quick way to tell is to check the screw pattern behind the glass.||||reg||1
